{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "19e4300d084aed2ec64503e9b37b783cbe732af747b2a91a31889f5d82b331af", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画のコラボで、\n美希はランチビュッフェのPRをすることになった）", "zh": "（与角色扮演写真企划合作，美希要为午餐自助餐进行宣传）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "d35ae1295a855014954b33976ecab07845c646b2d335471358183161eb96b4d7", "ja": "わあ……！　おいしそうな料理がいっぱいで、\nなんだかお腹が空いてきたの……。", "zh": "哇……！有好多看起来好好吃的料理，感觉肚子都饿起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2743a340f8e3d5f13244aceb31ef56aaeae4453a210c18c7e5f32c518b5c5c50", "ja": "そうだな。キツネは雑食で、肉類を好むようだからな。\nそれに合わせて、肉料理の品数を増やしたとか……。", "zh": "是啊。狐狸是杂食动物，似乎很喜欢肉类。所以就迎合这一点，多准备了几道肉菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "15a8f0ef02d45749cb1ba49cdc7d8b0fdbecc6daef21ed10388a6d89e9028514", "ja": "そうなんだね。あ、そういえば劇場にも、お肉が\n好きな子多いよね。雪歩とかのり子とか……あと翼も？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。啊，说起来，剧场里喜欢吃肉的孩子也很多呢。雪步、法子什么的……还有翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "25bae79defdcd1896e0520c8bb8b1757cbb6e84dc83b41dbb9653469c1ec50ab", "ja": "でもミキはやっぱり、おにぎりが一番好きだな♪\n{$P$}は何が好き？", "zh": "不过美希最喜欢的还是饭团♪\n{$P$}最喜欢什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0336339d4d97f686b4282a554f044dd830eec48ba760565e0d96c25217352599", "ja": "うーん、どの料理も美味しそうだからな……。", "zh": "嗯……每道菜看起来都很好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "9f36b1edbbb8e1539ee2ab1fb86ab707aceae7f18498b8d942159ae90c7ae6a1", "ja": "じゃあ、ミキが選んであげよっか！　ご飯のとこに\n特製親子丼があって、すっごく気になってたの。", "zh": "那就让美希来帮你选吧！饭菜那边有特制亲子丼，美希一直特别想尝尝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "e4be151853cac17fe99063ed5060ccdf15c003f1042013c0a3f2db518d63b832", "ja": "あっ。それとね、スイーツが面白いんだよ？\n自分でパフェを作って、食べられるんだって！", "zh": "啊，还有哦，那里的甜点很有意思呢？\n听说可以自己做芭菲来吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "9255efcb226395791c67ba19f90bcb4c0ae658851d64cedbe955d8bde084bf95", "ja": "ミキがハニーに作るなら、いちごババロアと\nチョコをトッピングして、最後におにぎりと……。", "zh": "如果是美希做给亲爱的，就会加上草莓巴伐露和巧克力，最后再放上饭团……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a6324adc7fb792905a4a158c596f5959792faf69fa41853fecd6bf2253ba4c27", "ja": "ま、待て待て！　ひとつ聞いていいか？\nもしかして、今あげたメニューって……。", "zh": "等等，等一下！能问你一件事吗？\n难道说，刚才列出来的那些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "1f0b30f07477afb63dfd2bd41665f4214f4e0a5ff6b23361110cf164836f18a9", "ja": "ミキの好きなものだよ？\nハニーと一緒に食べようかなって思って♪", "zh": "是美希喜欢的东西哦？\n我想着要不要和亲爱的你一起吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cd2f916add7a3398403f9d27e8a345fe331917e10d7ec765c1f1b0180425c15b", "ja": "まあ、インタビュー用に料理を食べる時間は\n取ってあるから、その時なら……。", "zh": "不过，已经安排好了接受采访、品尝料理的时间，所以到时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "35a220d6fd05c1b8700b2bee84b6133e15676bb52cc79cbbe523d5b9b6d16178", "ja": "ほんと！　じゃあ……\nハニーが、あーんして食べさせてくれる？", "zh": "真的！那……哈尼会喂我吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "20390a922c10557f3981586825ce70740d77353beb627c82a767206ee90288a8", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、それは……。", "zh": "咦！？不，那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "3c1fe53db7586a14bd8473e9e5bd78a03719b40e3b633db7f04e50c64e6744d8", "ja": "……なんかミキ、やる気なくなったの。\nお昼寝もしたいし、着替えて帰ろうかな……。", "zh": "……美希总觉得提不起干劲了。\n又想睡午觉，干脆换了衣服回家去吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ccd4f7bd5b0ebbe5efb7db8d7e9a5eb4697c31e1758e665de41b74177d56e647", "ja": "くっ……わ、わかった。美希と一緒に食べるよ。", "zh": "呃……我、我知道了。那就和美希一起吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc85df8c087e4fa327dd2a3e8c557ce4145b490d406d68e3fe11409f92a73251", "ja": "やったぁ☆　衣装が汚れちゃうといけないから、\nちゃーんとハニーが食べさせてね？　約束だよ♪", "zh": "太好啦☆　弄脏演出服可就不好了，\nHoney要好～好喂美希吃哦？说好了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0543_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bf901f30e6f3eee8da19798844c2ca9d74c3d5e3661e0a7b74482f88430694a9", "ja": "（結局、美希の罠に引っかかってしまった……。\n美希が楽しく仕事できるなら……まあ、仕方ないか）", "zh": "（结果还是中了美希的圈套……\n只要美希能开心地工作……那也没办法了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
